# NAME: AI Residential
# AUTHOR: puyoopuyoo
# DESCRIPTION: AI services that may benefit from residential or high-quality ISP nodes
# FORMAT: Loon Remote Rule
# POLICY: AI-Residential
# UPDATE: 2026-08-23
#
# INCLUDED:
# OpenAI / ChatGPT / Sora
# Google Gemini / AI Studio / NotebookLM
# Anthropic / Claude
# Meta AI
# ElevenLabs
#
# EXCLUDED:
# Mainland China AI services
# Low-risk AI services
# General cloud/CDN/auth/payment/analytics infrastructure
#
# NOTICE:
# Residential IP is not officially required by these services.
# A fixed, clean and region-supported exit IP is more important
# than the residential label itself.


